---
title: "Series — AETERNUS VERLAG"
description: "The six series of AETERNUS VERLAG: Anthracite, Green, Red, Blue, Amber, and White — with the authors and available titles in each."
layout: base.njk
lang: en
permalink: /en/series/index.html
---

<main>
<!-- SERIES OVERVIEW — English mirror of /reihen/. See reihen.njk for notes. -->
<section class="block" style="background-color: #161311; padding: 180px 0 112px; position: relative;">
  <div class="paper-grain" style="position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.15;pointer-events:none;"></div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div style="max-width: 720px; margin-bottom: 60px;">
      <div class="eyebrow-mini" style="color: var(--gold); letter-spacing: 0.15em; font-size: 0.85rem;">{{ i18n["series.eyebrow"][lang] }}</div>
      <h1 class="title-xl" style="margin-top: 15px; font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400;"><span class="gold-grad">{{ i18n["series.title"][lang] }}</span></h1>
      <div style="margin-top: 25px; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(243, 231, 207, 0.75);"><p>{{ i18n["series.intro"][lang] }}</p></div>
    </div>

    <div class="catalog-grid">
      {% for card in i18n.seriesItems %}
        <a href="/en/series/{{ card.slug }}/" class="series-overview-card">
          <div class="series-overview-thumb">
            <picture>
              <source type="image/avif" srcset="/assets/images/{{ card.mood.file }}.avif" />
              <source type="image/webp" srcset="/assets/images/{{ card.mood.file }}.webp" />
              <img src="/assets/images/{{ card.mood.file }}-fallback.jpg" alt="" style="object-position: {{ card.mood.focal }};" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
            </picture>
          </div>
          <div class="series-overview-body">
            <div class="series-overview-meta">
              <span>{{ card.num }}</span>
              <span class="swatch-row"><span class="swatch" style="background-color: {{ card.colorHex }};"></span>{{ card.colorName[lang] }}</span>
            </div>
            <h3>{{ card.label[lang] }}</h3>
            <p>{{ card.desc[lang] }}</p>
            <div class="series-overview-foot">
              <span class="authors-count">
                {% if card.authors.length == 0 %}{{ i18n["series.noAuthorsYet"][lang] }}{% elif card.authors.length == 1 %}1 {{ i18n["series.authorCount"][lang] }}{% else %}{{ card.authors.length }} {{ i18n["series.authorCountPlural"][lang] }}{% endif %}
              </span>
              <span class="go">{{ i18n["series.viewSeries"][lang] }} →</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
</main>
